    "description": "A detailed guide to setting up an aqua-terrarium for a turtle: dimensions, equipment, filter, UVB lamp and common mistakes.",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "NS Reptiles",
      "url": "https://nsreptiles.net"
    },
    "publisher": {
